 her own investigation.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-10-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dfqjy93XSjvKPazGeclfdNbKmY7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dfqjy93XSjvKPazGeclfdNbKmY7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21732/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"599624","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Human Reform League holds a memorial service for the soldiers whose lives were lost in the recent interventions, and reaffirms its opposition to Celestial Being.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-10-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rOwOTDYD1YDVOymSVgYf9emr7GO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rOwOTDYD1YDVOymSVgYf9emr7GO.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21732/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"599625","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Princess Marina leaves Azadistan and begins a worldwide diplomatic tour to seek help for her impoverished nation.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-11-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pzUycjUjA4RUAnAVAzvjYZajFal.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pzUycjUjA4RUAnAVAzvjYZajFal.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21732/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"599626","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Celestial Being's activities have reduced the level of conflict in the world, but there are some who do not welcome this change.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-11-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mw3AANeb0qROilee7jkiW2DUMaj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mw3AANeb0qROilee7jkiW2DUMaj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21732/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"599627","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"During Celestial Being's intervention in Moralia, Setsuna has been reunited with a figure from his past. His opponent is the mercenary soldier Ali al-Saachez.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-11-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nowo4C8QsgTUDSjNOXJf4o9HG3G.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nowo4C8QsgTUDSjNOXJf4o9HG3G.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21732/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"599628","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"An international terror network has begun a campaign of bombing attacks in order to force Celestial Being to halt its armed interventions.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-11-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g1SMakZKA07NPYrGumDkl3cla7C.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g1SMakZKA07NPYrGumDkl3cla7C.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21732/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"599629","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Four months have now passed since Celestial Being began its armed interventions. The initial chaos has subsided, and life goes on.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-12-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5xex0dUnKWwaQ5US56tgqbL81e6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5xex0dUnKWwaQ5US56tgqbL81e6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21732/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"599630","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In Earth orbit, Sergei's mobile suit team continues its attack on the Ptolemaios and the Gundam Meisters. While Setsuna and Lockon defend their mothership, Allelujah and Tieria find themselves caught in the enemy's trap.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-12-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fF9VcSTwAKfh0qcaNTBK3v7gGj7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fF9VcSTwAKfh0qcaNTBK3v7gGj7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21732/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"599631","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In the aftermath of the orbital battle, the Human Reform League's scientists realize that one of the Gundam Meisters is actually a former test subject of their own Superhuman Institute.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-12-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xN1Fywu9HNS3hMZ4sIKw7V1ITYQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xN1Fywu9HNS3hMZ4sIKw7V1ITYQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21732/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"599632","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Although Princess Marina has secured assistance from the United Nations for her troubled homeland, the Kingdom of Azadistan is still in turmoil.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-12-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"h